#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:92
msgid "Chromatic Aberration"
msgstr "Klöörafwieken"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:93
msgid "Chromatic aberration is easily recognised as color fringes towards the image corners. CA is due to a variing lens focus for different colors."
msgstr "Klöörafwieken lett sik eenfach kennen, dat gifft Klöörränners na dat Bild sien Huken hen. De Lins hett denn verscheden Brennwieden för de Klören."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:96
msgid "Vignetting"
msgstr "Randschadden"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:97
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Vignetting refers to an image darkening in the corners. Optical and natural vignetting can be cancelled out with this option, whereas mechanical vignetting will not be cured."
msgid "Vignetting refers to an image darkening, mostly in the corners. Optical and natural vignetting can be cancelled out with this option, whereas mechanical vignetting will not be cured."
msgstr "Randschadden bedüüdt, dat Bild warrt na de Huken hen düüsterer. Optsch un natüürlich Randschaddens laat sik mit disse Funkschoon wegmaken, mechaansche nich."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:100
msgid "Color Correction"
msgstr "Klöörrichten"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:101
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Lenses all have a slight color tinge to them, mostly due to the anti-reflective coating. The tinge can be taken away when the respective data is know for the lens."
msgid "All lenses have a slight color tinge to them, mostly due to the anti-reflective coating. The tinge can be cancelled when the respective data is known for the lens."
msgstr "All Linsen hebbt en Klöörfehler, in de Hööftsaak kummt dat vun de Antireflex-Laag. Disse Fehler lett sik richten, wenn Du de tohören Daten vun de Lins kennen deist."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:104
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Vertarren"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:105
msgid "Distortion refers to an image deformation, which is most pronounced towards the corners. These Seidel aberrations are known as pincushion and barrel distorsions."
msgstr "Vertarren is en leeg Weddergaav vun de Formen op't Bild un warrt na de Huken hen stärker. Disse Afbildfehlers sünd as »Küssen-« un »Tünnvertarren« begäng."

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:108
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Geometrie"

#. +> trunk
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:109
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Four geometries are handeled here: Rectilinear (99% of all lenses), Fisheye, Cylindrical, Equirectangular."
msgid "Four geometries are handeled here: Rectilinear (99 percent of all lenses), Fisheye, Cylindrical, Equirectangular."
msgstr "Hier sünd veer Buuformen mööglich: Liekut (99% vun all Linsen), Fischoog, Zylinnersch un Längdenliek Zylinnersch."

